pseudocode:
1. digits.sort((a, b) => b - a);
2. buckets = [[], [], []];
3. for d in digits: buckets[d % 3].push(d);
4. sum = digits.reduce((a, b) => a + b);
5. if sum % 3 == 1: remove smallest from bucket 1 or two from bucket 2;
6. if sum % 3 == 2: remove smallest from bucket 2 or two from bucket 1;
7. result = sort(all remaining digits).reverse().join('');
